  2. 18 years to 75 years (inclusive), male and female;
  3. Male subjects weight ≥50 kg and female subjects weight ≥45 kg. Body mass index (BMI) : 18-30 kg/m2 (inclusive) (BMI= weight (kg)/height2 (m\^2));
